	| Default Account Worker Role |
	And I assign the contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken" on the account "Koroneiki Automotive" to the following roles	
	| Optional Account Worker Role |
	And I create a product with the following values
	| Name | Liferay Digital Experience Platform | |
	And I generate static start and end dates
	And I create a product purchase for an account with the name "Koroneiki Automotive" and the product "Liferay Digital Experience Platform" on koroneiki with the following values
	| End Date                | ${staticEndDate}   |                |
	| Perpetual               | true               |                |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp1    | propertyValue1 |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp2    | propertyValue2 |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp3    | propertyValue3 |
	| Quantity                | 1                  |                |
	| Start Date              | ${staticStartDate} |                |
	And I create a contact entitlement definition related to the product purchase of the product "Liferay Digital Experience Platform" and contact role with the name "Default Account Worker Role" and type "Account Worker" with the following values
	| Description | Entitlement Description1 |
	| Name        | Entitlement Name1        |
	| Status      | Approved                 |
	And I create a contact entitlement definition related to the product purchase of the product "Liferay Digital Experience Platform" and contact role with the name "Optional Account Worker Role" and type "Account Worker" with the following values
	| Description | Entitlement Description2 |
	| Name        | Entitlement Name2        |
	| Status      | Approved                 |
	Then the contact entitlement definition with the name "Entitlement Name1" should be present with the following values
	| Description | Entitlement Description1 |
	| Name        | Entitlement Name1        |
	| Status      | Approved                 |
	And the contact entitlement definition with the name "Entitlement Name1" should be present via the entitlement definition key with the following values
	| Description | Entitlement Description1 |
	| Name        | Entitlement Name1        |
	| Status      | Approved                 |
	And the contact entitlement definition with the name "Entitlement Name2" should be present with the following values
	| Description | Entitlement Description2 |
	| Name        | Entitlement Name2        |
	| Status      | Approved                 |
	And the contact entitlement definition with the name "Entitlement Name2" should be present via the entitlement definition key with the following values
	| Description | Entitlement Description2 |
	| Name        | Entitlement Name2        |
	| Status      | Approved                 |
	When I synchronize the contact entitlement definition with the name "Entitlement Name1"
	And I synchronize the contact entitlement definition with the name "Entitlement Name2"
	And I create a nested field for the contact entitlement coming from the entitlement definition "Entitlement Name1"
	And I rename the first contact entitlement nested field variable
	And I create a nested field for the contact entitlement coming from the entitlement definition "Entitlement Name2"
	And I rename the second contact entitlement nested field variable
	Then I should be able to view a koroneiki contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken" and the following values
	| Email Address            | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken                                          |
	| Entitlement Nested Field | ${staticContactEntitlementsNestedField1},${staticContactEntitlementsNestedField2} |
	| First Name               | Koroneiki                                                                         |
	| Language                 | English                                                                           |
